        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146783,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sabemos cómo repetir código usando un bucle while. Como este programa de juego que repite declaraciones para dibujar un HUD simple.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter1 = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter1 &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: |||||  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter1++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter2 = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter2 &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: -----  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter2++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146784,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando <strong>bucles for</strong>, podemos reescribir el mismo programa de juego haciéndolo más fácil de entender para otros programadores.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: |||||  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: -----  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146785,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para crear un bucle <code>for</code>, comenzamos con la palabra clave <code>for</code>, paréntesis <code>( )</code> y llaves <code>{ }</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" () {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>for</code> seguido de <code>()</code> y luego <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146786,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un bucle for nos permite crear la variable contador dentro de los paréntesis, como <code>let frame = 1;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"19\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" frame = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>let frame = 1;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146787,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un nombre común para una variable contador es la letra <code>i</code>, que significa índice. La usaremos para aprender sobre los bucles <code>for</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"frame\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146788,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Después del punto y coma, colocamos una condición como <code>i &lt; 5</code> y añadimos otro punto y coma <code>;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i = 10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i &lt; 5</code> seguido de <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146789,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por último, incrementamos la variable contador con <code>i++</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i++</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>El código de un bucle for es más fácil de leer porque la información sobre las veces que se repite el bucle está dentro de los paréntesis.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tick &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>(</code> seguido de <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146791,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué tipo de bucle tiene esto?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un bucle for</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un bucle while</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un bucle for.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Dónde va la variable contador de un bucle for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dentro de los paréntesis <code>( )</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dentro de las llaves <code>{ }</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dentro de los paréntesis <code>( )</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es la variable de contador del bucle for?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power up!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss incoming!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146794,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué condición tiene el bucle for?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Start level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i &lt; 3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let i = 0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i &lt; 3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué está mal con este código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy id: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" i++\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i++</code> está fuera de los paréntesis <code>( )</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No hay nada malo con el código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i++</code> está fuera de los paréntesis <code>( )</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué es más fácil leer el código de un bucle for que el código de un bucle while?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: |||||  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: -----  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque el número de veces que se repite el bucle for está en un solo lugar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque el bucle for nos impide escribir bucles infinitos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque el número de veces que se repite el bucle for está en un solo lugar.</p></body></html>"
          },
