            "id": 146798,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dentro de los paréntesis, crea la variable contador con <code>let i = 5;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"15\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn point &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>let i = 5;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
